<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 19.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 19.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Thursday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     June 19     June 18   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  273.660     273.000     247.020   10.78 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.380     309.310     306.830    0.83 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  158.090     158.315     158.970   -0.55 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.854	46.904	47.182   -0.70 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  449.280     447.120     419.180    7.18 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.470     140.790     141.685   -0.86 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.140	16.156	16.185   -0.28 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  241.430     241.410     212.430   13.65 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.874	 1.879	 1.888   -0.74 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.570	 1.568	 1.581   -0.70 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  189.320     189.160     183.135    3.38 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
